  data: {
    LLM: "If you hold the Mensch (Qâ™£), you have the ultimate weapon. Save it to kill a trick where you suspect an opponent is playing their highest trump. If you are a secret partner, don't reveal yourself until the card you were called with is played; use your trumps to help the leader win early tricks.\n\nContract Selection: Only bid 'Solo' if you have at least 4 trumps (including high ones) and at least one Ace in a side suit. If you have a weak hand but hold the Mensch, bid 'Half' and call an Ace you don't have to secure a strong partner.\n\nThe 'Forced Club' lead: Since the Mensch is always a trump, leading a small Club can force the opponents to reveal if they are holding the Mensch early. If they win with it, you know they are out of their most powerful card for the end-game.",
    Player: "If you hold the Mensch (Qâ™£), you have the ultimate weapon. Save it to kill a trick where you suspect an opponent is playing their highest trump. If you are a secret partner, don't reveal yourself until the card you were called with is played; use your trumps to help the leader win early tricks.\n\nContract Selection: Only bid 'Solo' if you have at least 4 trumps (including high ones) and at least one Ace in a side suit. If you have a weak hand but hold the Mensch, bid 'Half' and call an Ace you don't have to secure a strong partner.\n\nThe 'Forced Club' lead: Since the Mensch is always a trump, leading a small Club can force the opponents to reveal if they are holding the Mensch early. If they win with it, you know they are out of their most powerful card for the end-game.",
